.TH "pango-segmentation" "1" "" "Pango" "Pango commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
pango-segmentation \- Pango text segmentation
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.nf
\fBpango\-segmentation\fP [OPTIONS...] [FILE]
.fi
.sp
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
\fBpango\-segmentation\fP shows text boundaries determined by Pango.
.sp
These can be graphemes (cursor positions), words boundaries, word
starts and ends, line break possibilities, sentence boundaries, or
sentence starts and ends.
.SH HELP OPTIONS
.sp
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Show help options.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-version\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Print the command\(aqs version and exit.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SH APPLICATION OPTIONS
.sp
\fB\-\-text=STRING\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Text to display (instead of \fBFILE\fP).
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-kind=KIND\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
The boundary to show. \fBKIND\fP can be one of grapheme, word, words, line, sentence,
sentences. (default: grapheme).
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
